I removed the column with GlobalId `2cfUxAWH1Dfex5auqOJp1K` (a 500 × 500 cast-in-place reinforced concrete column) and saved the model.

Before it was deleted, the column was linked to the model through these relationships:
- its placement on a storey;
- its type;
- its material;
- six property sets.

Its links to all of these were removed with it. If a relationship covered only this column, the whole relationship was deleted. Relationships shared with other elements (such as the storey containment, type or material) stay in place for those elements.

A check afterwards found the column is gone and no relationship now points to nothing. It held no doors or windows, so nothing else was removed.
